<title>DUBAI: Twenty killed in Iran as bus plunges into river.</title>
<headline>Twenty killed in Iran as bus plunges into river.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty people were killed and 11 injured when a bus plunged into a river in northern Iran, the official Iranian news agency IRNA said on Sunday.</p>
<p>It said the accident in Gilan province occurred on Friday.</p>
<p>Officials in Gilan said the cause of the accident was under investigation, IRNA said, but gave no further details.</p>
